if DialogueDump.angelending >= 5
	ANGEL: There are few people who can put their personal feelings aside.
	ANGEL: And make the right decision.
	ANGEL: You made the right decision five times in a row.
	ANGEL: I'm so proud of you.
	
	DEVIL: It's the only [#italicize 'only'] right decision you made all day.
	
	=> angelending

else DialogueDump.angelending <= 4
	ANGEL: I know these decisions may feel unfair... 
	ANGEL: But are times when mercy is fairer because it's random.
	=> endingchecks

~ chloehell
ANGEL: Do you have no heart?
ANGEL: Haven't you sent enough people to the pit today?

DEMON: Don't listen to her.
DEMON: The only thing more delightful than sending bad people to Hell... is sending them to Heaven.  
=> endingchecks

~ endingchecks
if DialogueDump.demonending == 5
